1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:05,930
Every day, India's food brands ship millions of packs to their distributors.

2
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:08,243
But some batches don't sell in time.

3
00:00:08,293 --> 00:00:17,206
Weeks before expiry, quick commerce turns them away. The stock is written off, the GST credit reversed, and good food goes to landfill.

4
00:00:17,556 --> 00:00:20,634
Smart-Clearance turns that write-off into recovery.

5
00:00:20,684 --> 00:00:30,363
It is software as a service for FMCG brands: each gets its own workspace, where AI agents find the best exit for every pack at risk.

6
00:00:30,613 --> 00:00:37,228
Ten agents on Gemini, built with Google's Agent Development Kit, walk every batch through nine stops.

7
00:00:37,278 --> 00:00:43,691
The Watcher spots the risk. Vision verifies the label. The Valuer and the Router price every exit.

8
00:00:43,641 --> 00:00:45,527
Then one person says yes.

9
00:00:45,477 --> 00:00:53,051
Outreach, the Lister and the Negotiator sell. Paperwork files the GST papers, and Impact posts the ledger.

10
00:00:53,301 --> 00:00:59,170
And from one console, the team watches every client live, and tunes each brand's agents.

11
00:01:00,620 --> 00:01:05,104
Now, Munchly Foods, live on production. First, the demo setup.

12
00:01:05,154 --> 00:01:14,449
Neha resets the journey from the console and picks Rehearsal: one journey day passes in an hour, so the story's real best-before dates still hold.

13
00:01:14,599 --> 00:01:25,603
She can also run any agent by hand. The Watcher flags the Mango Drink at Lakshmi Agencies in Hyderabad: twenty-two days left, and twenty-two thousand rupees at stake.

14
00:01:25,753 --> 00:01:32,448
Lakshmi Agencies photographs the carton. Vision matches its batch, dates and price to the stock export.

15
00:01:32,598 --> 00:01:39,532
The Valuer prices five exits, and the Router recommends a split: kiranas, a staff sale and a food bank.

16
00:01:39,582 --> 00:01:43,630
Priya approves it with one tap. Nothing moves before her yes.

17
00:01:43,880 --> 00:01:52,070
Outreach sends a Hindi offer to fifty-eight kiranas. As each shop orders on its phone, the order lands on Priya's screen, live.

18
00:01:52,220 --> 00:01:58,086
Fifty-two shops take thirteen hundred and seventy-two packets, each with its own tax invoice.

19
00:01:58,236 --> 00:02:04,755
The distributor's staff buy a hundred and fifty packs. Vision checks the UPI receipt against the count.

20
00:02:04,905 --> 00:02:08,936
Feeding India collects the last fifty-eight, and issues its receipt.

21
00:02:09,086 --> 00:02:16,133
Paperwork drafts every paper: the price-support credit note, the GST memo and an invoice for every shop.

22
00:02:16,283 --> 00:02:27,951
Munchly recovers nearly seventeen thousand rupees instead of losing twenty-two thousand. Lakshmi Agencies ends whole, and three hundred and forty kilos stay out of landfill.

23
00:02:29,801 --> 00:02:36,948
But not every batch sells. Munchly's Masala Chips at Rakesh Traders in Nagpur go to thirty-eight kiranas.

24
00:02:37,098 --> 00:02:41,277
This time, just two of them order. Thirty-five say, not this time.

25
00:02:41,427 --> 00:02:51,350
On ExpireSoon, a wholesaler bids thirteen rupees. The Negotiator counters at fourteen twenty, and seven hundred and seventy-two packs are sold.

26
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:58,910
In the demo, Neha closes the offer window early from the console. Five hundred and forty packets are left at the godown.

27
00:02:59,060 --> 00:03:11,168
On expiry day, they are destroyed, against evidence. Rakesh sends photos from before and after, and the agency's officer, two witnesses and Rakesh sign the certificate on his tablet.

28
00:03:11,318 --> 00:03:17,421
Vision checks the label, the count and the slate at the landfill. Then Priya gives a second yes.

29
00:03:17,571 --> 00:03:22,209
Only then are the destruction certificate and the expiry credit note issued.

30
00:03:22,359 --> 00:03:31,272
Even here, Munchly recovers eleven thousand seven hundred rupees against a twenty-six thousand rupee write-off, and Rakesh ends whole.

31
00:03:31,922 --> 00:03:36,356
Smart-Clearance. Ten agents, one yes, and nothing good goes to waste.
